{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-03-22 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT EXPANDS E-MOBILITY CHARGING TEST PORTFOLIO', 'text': "SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #CCS--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS) HAS EXPANDED ITS ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) AND ELECTRIC VEHICLE SUPPLY EQUIPMENT (EVSE) CHARGING TEST PORTFOLIO TO CREATE AN INDUSTRY-LEADING TOOLSET OF DESIGN, EMULATION, AND TEST SOLUTIONS FOR E-MOBILITY. THE NEWLY INTRODUCED TOOLS COMPLEMENT KEYSIGHT'S EV / EVSE CHARGING TEST PORTFOLIO WITH COMPONENT-LEVEL AND FIELD TESTING SOLUTIONS."}